  "description": "Speck Folding Bike is perfect for the rider that is big on convenience but low on space. Whether you’re pedaling your way across campus, heading in to the office, or packing up the RV for a quick getaway, the convenience of this folding bike is unmatched.\nTHE FRAME\nSpeck’s aluminum frame is 30% lighter than our competitor’s steel and chrome alloy framed folding bikes. Making it easier to carry and a lightweight joy to ride.\nCONVENIENCE IS KEY\n﻿Because Speck Folding Bike is so compact, it’s a great option for any rider, in and out of the city. Take it to and from work, school, and home and then put it away in some small, hidden space (maybe your Harry Potter closet?). You can even get meta with it — get some transportation ON other transportation and bring it on the bus, subway, and ferry. You can. Because it’s so compact.\nEASY RIDING\n\nTaking your bike on an adventure farther away from buses and subways and ferries? No problem. Retrospec Speck Folding Bicycle is ideal for camping trips and other outdoor escapades. When folded, this bike is small, light, and self-containing. It can be so discreetly placed in some crevice of your boat, RV, tent, or four-wheel drive jeep that when you pull it out, your friends will be like, “Whoa, man, where could you have possibly pulled that bike out of?” Get wild in the wilderness with this folding bike that is anything but cumbersome.\n\n*Due to differences in screen resolutions, please note that colors may differ slightly.",
